      <h2><font color="#333333" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Thank you, 
        neighbors!</font></h2>
      <table width="200" height="200" border="1" align="center" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0" bordercolor="#3a9cb8">
        <tr> 
          <td align="center" valign="middle" height="276"> 
            <div align="left"><a href="http://www.artscollinwood.org/index.php?option=com_rsgallery2&catid=3"><img src="images_sg/sand%20scupture.JPG" width="374" height="243" border="0"></a></div>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr align="center" valign="middle"> 
          <td><em><b><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Sand Sculptures</font></b></em></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    <p align="left"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">This project has 
        been made possible with the enthusiastic support of many <br>
        individuals in and around North Collinwood. Thank you to the more than 
        70 neighborhood associations and institutions - <br>
        including block clubs, park clubs, churches, and government offices - 
        which responded to the call for submissions. We humbly hope you find this 
        piece worth tacking to the fridge for the next 3 months.</font></p>
      <p align="left"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">With love, The 
        North Collinwood Summer Guide Committee<br>
        Members: Susan M. Brandt, Tarrymore and The 185th Street Barbershop;Nancy 
        Croft, East Shore Park Club; Dennis Dooley, Overlook Park; Bev Franczyk, 
        Kewanee Avenue; Sarah Gyorki, Canterbury Road &amp; Arts Collinwood; Meredith 
        Pangrace, Shore Acres; Erin Randel, Rosecliff Road; <br>
        Terry Ross, Canterbury Road; Carol Ward, Cleveland Lakefront State Park, 
        with Junior Members Emma Gyorki, Deirdre Robertson and Mary Sin&eacute;ad 
        Robertson.</font></p>
      <table width="800" cellpadding="2" height="0%" bordercolor="#3a9cb8" border="2">
        <tr>
          <td height="80"> 
            <div align="center">
              <p><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">For more information 
                or to get involved in this project, please email <a href="mailto:summer@artscollinwood.org">summer@artscollinwood.org</a> 
                <br>
                or <br>
                </font> <font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Summer 
                Guide c/o <br>
                Arts Collinwood, 15605 Waterloo Rd.<br>
                Cleveland, OH 44110</font> 
            </div>
          </td>
        </tr>
